    perf(overlay): reveal before focusing

    The panel spent the focus and topmost work with no backdrop on screen: the glass was revealed only after SetFocus and the Z-order re-assert. It is now revealed as soon as the page is visible, so the gap is only the show itself.

    Moving it earlier still, ahead of the foreground request and ShowWindow, put glass on screen before the page and flashed the backdrop alone. The reveal has to follow the page becoming visible.

